="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>HAYASHI AKIO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>HOSOTANI RYUZO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SHIMADA KUNIO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SUNAMOTO JUNZO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YANO YOSHIHIRO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>AKIYOSHI, KAZUNARI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HAYASHI, AKIO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HOSOTANI, RYUZO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SHIMADA, KUNIO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SUNAMOTO, JUNZO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YANO, YOSHIHIRO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>Cosmetics containing polysaccharide-sterol derivatives which comprise cosmetic components and polysaccharide-sterol derivatives. Because of being excellent in the moisture-maintaining and film-forming effects, these cosmetics can ameliorate disorders in the skin and the hair caused by dryness (for example, skin chapping and insufficient gloss) and moisten the skin and the hair by maintaining sufficient moisture, thereby achieving the effects of making the skin and the hair beautiful. In addition, these cosmetics have favorable texture. Owing to these characteristics, the cosmetics are appropriately usable as skin-care products, makeup products, hair-care products, etc.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne des produits cosmétiques contenant des dérivés de polysaccharide-stérol constitués de composants cosmétiques et de dérivés de polysaccharide-stérol. Etant donné qu'ils présentent une excellente capacité d'hydratation et de formation de film, ces produits cosmétiques peuvent s'avérer efficaces contre les problèmes de peau et de cheveux causés par la sécheresse (comme les gerçures ou le manque de brillance des cheveux). Ils permettent aussi d'hydrater la peau et les cheveux en retenant suffisamment d'humidité, contribuant ainsi à embellir la peau et les cheveux. De plus, ces produits cosmétiques ont une texture agréable. Du fait de ces particularités, ces produits cosmétiques peuvent être utilisés comme des produits pour le soin de la peau, des produits de maquillage, des produits pour le soin des cheveux, etc.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>